me Service</div><img class="dhs-signature-img" src="images/dhs-signature.png" alt="DHS Authorized Signature"><img class="dhs-stamp-img" src="images/dhs-stamp.png" alt="DHS Stamp"></div><div class="dhs-totals"><div class="dhs-tline"><span>Sub Total</span><b id="pSubtotal">â‚¹0.00</b></div><div class="dhs-tline"><span>Discount</span><b id="pDiscount">- â‚¹0.00</b></div><div class="dhs-ttotal"><span>Total Amount</span><span id="pTotal">â‚¹0.00</span></div><div class="dhs-words" id="pWords">(Rupees Zero Only)</div><div class="dhs-status" id="pStatus">Payment Status: PAID</div></div></div></div><div class="dhs-footer">âœ“ Verified Professionals <span>|</span> âœ“ On Time Service <span>|</span> âœ“ Trusted by Customers <span>|</span> âœ“ Quality Assured</div></div><div class="bill-preview-actions"><button class="bill-print" onclick="printBill()">ğŸ–¨ Print / PDF</button><button class="bill-download" onclick="downloadPDF()">â¬‡ Download PDF</button><button style="background:#0a9d42;color:#fff" onclick="payCash()">ğŸ’µ Pay Cash</button><button style="background:#6d28d9;color:#fff" onclick="payQR()">â–£ Pay QR</button><button class="bill-close" onclick="document.getElementById('invoice')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">View Bill</button></div></div></section>
