<div class="profileSettingsTitle"><b>Settings</b><small>DHS Partner App Settings</small></div>
<div class="settingsCard"><button class="settingsItem help" onclick="openSlideCall('dhs')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.3 1.7.6 2.5a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.6a16 16 0 0 0 6.4 6.4l1.3-1.2a2 2 0 0 0 2.1-.5c.8.3 1.6.5 2.5.6A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.9Z"/></svg><span class="siText"><b data-i18n="callHelp">Call Help â€” DHS</b><small data-i18n="slideToCall">Slide to call DHS Help</small></span><span class="chev">â€º</span></button></div>
